<title>USA: TJX Cos Inc Nov same-store sales rise 4 pct.</title>
<headline>TJX Cos Inc Nov same-store sales rise 4 pct.</headline>
<dateline>FRAMINGHAM, Mass. 1996-12-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Percent change</p>
<p>		    1996	 1995	     Total     Same-Store</p>
<p>Month		 $663	 $509	+ 30	  + 4</p>
<p>Year-to-date    $5,455     $2,872	+ 90	 N.A.</p>
<p>NOTE: Figures in millions except percentage.</p>
<p>Results exclude Chadwicks of Boston unit sales, since it was sold.</p>
<p>Company acquired Marshall's from the company that was formerly know as Melville Corp on November 17, 1995.</p>
